## CHECKPOINT 4: Data Preparation Complete

### Phase 4 Summary: Dataset Preparation

I have created three analysis datasets:

#### 1. Extension Dataset (`extension_analysis.csv`)
- **349 observations** for 2020-2024
- California: 174 rows (58 counties × 3 years)
- Utah: 58 rows (29 counties × 2 years; 2022 excluded)
- Washington: 117 rows (39 counties × 3 years)

#### 2. Combined Dataset (`combined_analysis.csv`)
- **1,803 observations** spanning 1996-2024
- Merges original data with extension data
- 15 election cycles across CA, UT, WA

#### 3. California-Only Dataset (`california_analysis.csv`)
- **812 observations** (1998-2024)
- Primary dataset for VCA analysis
- Staggered treatment adoption provides identification

### Treatment Status Summary

**California VCA Adoption (Key for Analysis):**
| Year | Treated Counties | Rate |
|------|-----------------|------|
| 2018 | 5 | 8.6% |
| 2020 | 15 | 25.9% |
| 2022 | 27 | 46.6% |
| 2024 | 29 | 50.0% |

**Utah & Washington:** All counties treated (universal VBM statewide)

### Key Outcome Variables Computed
- `dem_share_pres`: Democratic two-party vote share (presidential)
- `dem_share_gov`: Democratic two-party vote share (gubernatorial)
- `dem_share_sen`: Democratic two-party vote share (senate, WA only)
- `turnout_share`: Ballots cast / CVAP

